    teacher: "Some learners have grown up without experiencing love and find it hard to believe in God's love. Be patient and compassionate. Avoid presenting the Father as an angry judge placated by a reluctant Son; the Father gave the Son out of love. Affirm that the Trinity acted together in salvation.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners to say what John 3:16 teaches about the giver, the gift and the condition.",
    mcq1: ["What did God give according to John 3:16?", ["His only Son", "A new law", "An angel", "A prophet"], 0, "God gave his only Son."],
